WEBVTT

00:08.590 --> 00:10.410
<i>Out shopping for dinner.</i>

00:15.200 --> 00:17.580
<b>Please take me home</b>

00:59.870 --> 01:07.000
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

02:13.980 --> 02:17.650
Can

02:13.980 --> 02:17.650
<b>A Masterful Cat Has a Lot of Worries</b>

02:17.780 --> 02:18.990
<b>A Masterful Cat Has a Lot of Worries</b>

02:17.860 --> 02:18.990
Can

02:38.820 --> 02:42.300
Yuki-chan! What are you doing here?!

02:44.720 --> 02:46.530
Oh, me?

02:46.530 --> 02:49.340
I was, um... What was it again?

02:49.340 --> 02:50.480
Oh! That's right!

02:51.230 --> 02:54.270
I was looking for a new home!

02:55.910 --> 02:57.480
For this kitten!

03:02.140 --> 03:03.840
It was in this box.

03:03.840 --> 03:08.630
I want to keep it, but pets 
aren't allowed at home.

03:08.630 --> 03:13.500
Grandma can't keep it because 
Grandma's eyes aren't good.

03:14.080 --> 03:18.580
That's why I'm gonna stay with it 
until someone takes it home.

03:23.460 --> 03:25.050
No! I'm not going home!

03:25.050 --> 03:26.530
It's not cold!

03:26.530 --> 03:27.970
Not going home! Not going home!

03:27.970 --> 03:30.760
I won't go home no matter what!

03:56.670 --> 04:01.670
Snug

03:57.880 --> 04:00.630
Yume's gonna live here from now on!

04:05.810 --> 04:08.250
What's wrong with the kitty?

04:08.250 --> 04:10.140
Oh! Is it hungry?

04:10.140 --> 04:12.140
Yuki-chan, can you give it milk?!

04:13.830 --> 04:15.040
<i>I am a male cat.</i>

04:16.250 --> 04:19.680
That will be 2,318 yen.

04:19.980 --> 04:20.690
Huh?!

04:21.860 --> 04:23.710
<i>Did he have a kid?</i>

04:21.990 --> 04:24.200
Feeding Bottle

04:21.990 --> 04:24.200
Kitten Milk

04:24.200 --> 04:26.270
Wow! It's drinking it!

04:26.270 --> 04:27.450
It's so cute!

04:28.190 --> 04:29.920
I...

04:29.920 --> 04:32.500
I really wanna keep it...

04:32.500 --> 04:37.000
Then I could feed it milk every 
day and sleep in the same bed.

04:37.000 --> 04:42.430
I would play with it every day and 
once it got as big as Yuki-chan...

04:42.430 --> 04:45.720
We could go see UMYU-Sea together!

04:52.030 --> 04:53.170
It's raining.

04:53.170 --> 04:54.800
The kitty'll get wet!

04:54.800 --> 04:57.600
Get in my coat!

05:00.020 --> 05:02.360
Wh-Where are we going?!

05:09.470 --> 05:11.130
My, my, my, my!

05:11.130 --> 05:13.310
How cute.

05:13.310 --> 05:16.020
"Please take me home," it says.

05:16.020 --> 05:18.790
Are you looking for someone 
to take this kitten home?

05:18.790 --> 05:21.210
Will you take it in, Granny?

05:21.210 --> 05:27.140
Well, we're allowed to keep one pet here,

05:27.140 --> 05:30.300
but my age has gotten the better of me.

05:32.210 --> 05:34.860
Let me ask one of my friends.

05:35.810 --> 05:37.810
<b>Swift</b>

05:40.370 --> 05:46.220
Oh, Shokichi-san's married grandchild 
has been wanting to raise a cat.

05:47.870 --> 05:51.030
I can take care of it until 
they come to pick it up.

05:51.030 --> 05:53.270
Bye-bye, kitty.

05:53.270 --> 05:55.040
Stay healthy!

06:08.390 --> 06:09.840
Hey, Yuki-chan.

06:11.740 --> 06:15.090
Do you think the kitty will forget about me?

06:30.080 --> 06:32.040
Wow! It's drinking it!

06:32.040 --> 06:33.160
It's so cute!

06:33.650 --> 06:35.240
I...

06:35.240 --> 06:37.160
I really wanna keep it...

06:37.160 --> 06:40.530
I can take care of it until 
they come to pick it up.

06:40.830 --> 06:42.900
Bye-bye, kitty.

06:42.900 --> 06:44.720
Stay healthy!

07:03.320 --> 07:05.100
Yume!

07:06.530 --> 07:08.210
I finally found you!

07:08.210 --> 07:10.450
Where did you run off to?!

07:09.260 --> 07:10.450
Oh, Mom!

07:10.450 --> 07:14.450
You can't run off without 
saying where you're going!

07:14.790 --> 07:17.580
Oh? What happened to the kitten?

07:17.970 --> 07:21.080
Yuki-chan's friend's friend...

07:21.080 --> 07:23.500
<i>Giant cat kidnaps little girl.</i>

07:21.080 --> 07:25.340
<b>The little girl was found due to her 
crying and loud resistance. 
The culprit has been arrested. 
During the investigation, 
the culprit claimed, "I really 
wasn't planning on eating her."</b>

07:23.500 --> 07:26.570
I'm sorry for causing you trouble, Yuki-san.

07:27.550 --> 07:30.650
Thank you for finding a home for the kitten.

07:30.650 --> 07:32.720
Thanks, Yuki-chan!

07:32.720 --> 07:35.800
Let's live together in the park again!

07:43.310 --> 07:49.150
The granny next door 
who is tempted to raise it
 after thinking,
 "Maybe it'll grow just as 
big as Yukichi?"

07:43.600 --> 07:49.150
<b>Stare...</b>

07:55.450 --> 07:59.750
Pervert assaulting girls sighted
<b>in the neighborhood!!
 Please report any suspicious sightings!!
 Culprit's Description:
  • Male 30 to 50 years old
 • 160 to 170 cm tall
 • Black sweats
 • Gray sneakers
 • He only targets women with black hair.
 Seen wearing a dark-colored baseball cap

 TEL XXX-XXX-XXXX
Kuroyoshi Police</b>

07:55.830 --> 07:59.260
Goodness, a pervert in the area?

07:59.750 --> 08:04.080
This is the first time I've seen a flier 
like this in our neighborhood! How scary.

08:04.080 --> 08:07.820
Isn't Saku-chan coming home late today, too?

08:07.820 --> 08:10.070
I hope she'll be all right.

08:10.070 --> 08:13.760
It's not like you can wait 
for her at the station.

08:14.210 --> 08:17.210
I hope they catch the culprit soon.

08:23.310 --> 08:25.860
<i>A train at full capacity is arriving.</i>

08:27.680 --> 08:29.570
Welcome.

08:30.190 --> 08:33.320
<i>This guy's been coming a lot lately.</i>

08:34.820 --> 08:38.530
<b>Security Buzzer</b>

08:34.820 --> 08:38.530
<b>Very Loud</b>

08:34.820 --> 08:38.530
<b>with Flashlight</b>

08:35.510 --> 08:38.530
<i>A security buzzer and pepper spray?</i>

08:38.530 --> 08:43.610
<i>Oh, yeah. There's been talk about a pervert 
walking around assaulting women.</i>

08:43.610 --> 08:46.480
<i>The manager mentioned it 
during the morning meeting.</i>

08:47.310 --> 08:49.690
Thank you very much.

08:50.090 --> 08:53.770
<i>Huh? Is the person inside 
the cat suit actually a woman?!</i>

08:54.810 --> 08:57.310
<i>I thought it was some old man.</i>

09:23.790 --> 09:27.710
Pervert assaulting girls sighted
<b>in the neighborhood!!
 Please report any suspicious sightings!!
 Culprit's Description:
  • Male 30 to 50 years old
 • 160 to 170 cm tall
 • Black sweats
 • Gray sneakers
 • He only targets women with black hair.
 Seen wearing a dark-colored baseball cap

 TEL XXX-XXX-XXXX
Kuroyoshi Police</b>

09:41.070 --> 09:43.430
Hey! What are you doing?!

09:43.430 --> 09:45.770
Hey, come on! Listen to me!

09:52.270 --> 09:54.280
S-Someone! Help!

09:54.280 --> 09:56.740
There's no need to scream, Rio!

09:57.100 --> 09:59.820
We should talk a little more 
before breaking up!

09:59.820 --> 10:01.780
A bear?!

10:01.780 --> 10:03.610
C-Cat-san?!

10:03.610 --> 10:04.910
Are you stupid?!

10:04.910 --> 10:07.980
There's no way a cat would be that big!

10:07.980 --> 10:10.460
Don't call me stupid!

10:10.460 --> 10:12.420
That's what I hate about you!

10:12.420 --> 10:13.470
Shut up!

10:13.470 --> 10:15.670
Just come over here, stupid!

10:17.450 --> 10:19.090
What the hell is wrong with you?!

10:19.090 --> 10:20.650
Are you freaking kidding me?!

10:20.650 --> 10:22.720
You stupid bear!

10:50.460 --> 10:52.760
Hey! What are you doing?!

10:54.460 --> 10:56.460
S-Someone! Help!

10:56.460 --> 10:58.970
There's no need to scream, Rio!

11:00.610 --> 11:01.990
What the hell is wrong with you?!

11:01.990 --> 11:03.800
Are you freaking kidding me?!

11:03.800 --> 11:05.550
You stupid bear!

11:14.180 --> 11:15.730
Ouch...

11:15.730 --> 11:17.710
What the hell are you doing?!

11:17.710 --> 11:18.830
I'm gonna kill you!

11:18.830 --> 11:21.200
Perfect. You've been recorded.

11:21.690 --> 11:22.860
What are you going to do?

11:22.860 --> 11:27.490
Will you promise to go home and never 
come around this neighborhood again?

11:28.580 --> 11:33.000
Or will you be paying a visit 
to the police station with me?

11:36.860 --> 11:39.130
L-Like hell I'd ever come here again!

11:53.900 --> 11:56.310
Thank goodness he was a weakling!

11:56.780 --> 11:58.540
That surprised me!

11:58.540 --> 12:02.100
I followed the commotion 
and found you here, Yukichi!

12:02.430 --> 12:04.910
Oh, are either of you hurt?

12:04.910 --> 12:08.720
Was it all right to let him go?
 Should we chase after him?

12:08.720 --> 12:11.710
Oh, um, thank you very much.

12:12.510 --> 12:14.800
He was really persistent...

12:14.800 --> 12:16.800
Oh, haven't I seen you somewhere before?

12:16.800 --> 12:19.710
Yes! My name is Rio. I work 
as a cashier at the supermarket.

12:20.090 --> 12:23.550
You're very strong! Who are you?!

12:24.220 --> 12:28.050
No, no. I've really lost my touch.

12:28.640 --> 12:32.390
<b>Currently frozen...</b>

12:28.750 --> 12:32.390
Oh, do the two of you know each other?

12:32.390 --> 12:35.230
<b>Currently
frozen...</b>

12:32.390 --> 12:35.230
<b>...in a cat-like state.</b>

12:32.390 --> 12:35.230
Yes! He's a regular at our supermarket...

12:37.230 --> 12:42.240
<b>Currently
frozen...</b>

12:37.230 --> 12:42.240
<b>...in a cat-like state.</b>

12:38.310 --> 12:40.100
A police car! It's the police!

12:40.100 --> 12:41.080
Let's run, Yukichi!

12:41.080 --> 12:42.590
I mean! Let's go home!

12:42.590 --> 12:43.700
U-Um!

12:43.700 --> 12:45.900
Which way is your house, Rio-san?!

12:46.820 --> 12:53.870
<b>Currently frozen...
...in a cat-like state.</b>

12:48.670 --> 12:52.800
I'll stay behind and explain to 
the officers that it was just a lovers' spat.

12:49.660 --> 12:53.870
<b>Continuing to gather himself...</b>

12:54.520 --> 12:57.500
It'll be troublesome for your 
cat to be here, so please go!

12:57.500 --> 12:59.880
R-Right. Thanks.

13:00.590 --> 13:02.400
We'll be off, then!

13:02.400 --> 13:03.790
Let's go, Yukichi.

13:12.390 --> 13:14.530
Hurry!

13:15.720 --> 13:18.900
Why don't you run on all fours?!

13:19.520 --> 13:20.830
<i>I missed my chance.</i>

13:20.830 --> 13:23.100
<i>I wanted to ask her for her name...</i>

13:23.650 --> 13:25.300
<i>We have news on the serial assaulter</i>

13:25.220 --> 13:28.660
I'm definitely gonna be sore tomorrow.

13:25.300 --> 13:28.010
<i>that has been threatening Kuroyoshi 
city in K prefecture since last week.</i>

13:28.010 --> 13:32.210
<i>A male suspect in his fifties 
has just been arrested.</i>

13:28.660 --> 13:34.660
<b>Useless Cat</b>

13:29.590 --> 13:31.690
We're in the Kuroyoshi area!

13:31.690 --> 13:35.880
Huh? Could it be that you were 
coming to get me because of this?

13:32.210 --> 13:39.670
<i>The victims were all women who had 
no prior association with the culprit.</i>

13:36.210 --> 13:39.670
And why are you sulking 
in the corner like that?

13:41.060 --> 13:43.310
Jeez, that's so unlike you!

13:43.310 --> 13:45.420
Everything's fine now! Thanks!

13:45.880 --> 13:48.930
But I'm so hungry after all that exercise!

13:51.640 --> 13:53.360
He recovers so fast!

13:53.770 --> 13:55.640
What's for dinner today?

14:01.030 --> 14:02.330
<i>A few days later.</i>

14:09.370 --> 14:13.190
Manager, I found out the name of that cat.

14:13.190 --> 14:14.410
What?!

14:15.290 --> 14:17.740
C-Can you tell me?

14:17.740 --> 14:19.420
Of course not.

14:20.010 --> 14:21.920
Aren't you being way too cold?!

14:21.920 --> 14:23.500
It's private information.

14:23.500 --> 14:25.920
You're really gonna make me cry soon!

14:31.640 --> 14:34.140
<i>I am a cat.</i>

14:44.270 --> 14:47.280
<i>However, I am no ordinary cat!</i>

15:01.780 --> 15:04.550
<i>On that unseasonably snowy night...</i>

15:19.040 --> 15:21.850
If you have nowhere to go, 
how about coming with me?

15:23.390 --> 15:27.360
<i>There was a peculiar human that spoke to me.</i>

15:29.280 --> 15:32.160
<i>I was a stray cat covered in filth.</i>

15:33.030 --> 15:35.950
<i>One who knew he would soon expire...</i>

16:05.650 --> 16:08.800
Your name... Let's see.

16:10.190 --> 16:11.650
How about Yukichi?

16:13.460 --> 16:20.160
<i>The odd name she gave me on a whim 
strangely felt just right...</i>

16:21.530 --> 16:26.520
<i>That was the moment I knew 
I would become a house cat.</i>

16:40.710 --> 16:44.270
<i>However, that was also 
a misunderstanding on my part.</i>

16:42.200 --> 16:45.470
Okay! This is your new home from now on!

16:45.470 --> 16:48.480
<i>She took me to a garbage collection center.</i>

16:49.730 --> 16:53.020
<i>This human lives in a trash dump?</i>

16:53.490 --> 16:58.330
<i>Well, it's warmer than outside 
and seems pretty safe.</i>

16:58.330 --> 17:00.570
Aren't you hungry?

17:01.950 --> 17:05.360
Since you're a kitten, can you drink milk?

17:07.050 --> 17:11.300
Oops! This milk expired three months ago!

17:11.300 --> 17:14.330
It's become a weird yellow 
substance. Is it cheese?!

17:15.320 --> 17:18.890
<i>Dangerous! This human is dangerous!</i>

17:19.470 --> 17:21.600
Is there anything else to eat?

17:22.230 --> 17:24.800
When did I put dried squid in the freezer?

17:25.140 --> 17:28.800
Oh, it's mackerel! 
I'll pretend I didn't see that...

17:28.800 --> 17:30.040
<i>I must escape!</i>

17:30.970 --> 17:32.650
Oh, Yukichi! Don't go that way!

17:35.900 --> 17:37.090
Watch out!

17:42.890 --> 17:44.910
Are you okay, Yukichi?!

17:47.000 --> 17:50.210
Thank goodness. Are you hurt anywhere?

17:50.210 --> 17:51.700
Ouch...

17:51.700 --> 17:56.280
<i>Th-This human protected me 
with her own body?!</i>

17:56.280 --> 17:59.440
Sorry, I've been so busy lately...

18:00.900 --> 18:04.180
The place is a <i>little</i> messy right now.

18:04.180 --> 18:05.730
<i>The root of all evil.</i>

18:06.480 --> 18:09.730
I'll go buy some cat food 
at the convenience store!

18:11.220 --> 18:12.730
<i>It's snowing so hard outside.</i>

18:13.170 --> 18:15.220
<i>She looks so tired...</i>

18:15.220 --> 18:16.240
Whoa! So cold!

18:16.930 --> 18:18.980
<i>A stray cat knows.</i>

18:19.320 --> 18:22.320
<i>That is the face of a human in dire straits.</i>

18:23.730 --> 18:28.660
<i>She shouldn't have the energy 
to be kind to others...</i>

18:41.130 --> 18:44.720
<i>How could I have allowed 
myself to fall asleep?!</i>

18:44.720 --> 18:49.730
<b>Yukichi's House</b>

19:00.640 --> 19:05.760
<i>Why does a freeloader like me have 
more of a bed than the homeowner?</i>

19:06.580 --> 19:09.170
<i>Wait, why does she have 
a pillow and blanket there?</i>

19:09.170 --> 19:12.090
<i>Is this how she normally sleeps?!</i>

19:20.180 --> 19:24.640
<i>She should have just turned
her back on a stray like me.</i>

19:25.880 --> 19:32.160
<i>Now, how should I pay her back 
for one night of room and board?</i>

19:33.470 --> 19:37.860
<i>Thank you for boarding this train. 
Please wait for the next train.</i>

19:42.460 --> 19:43.330
I'm late!

19:43.330 --> 19:45.830
I fell asleep in my suit!

19:45.830 --> 19:50.290
<b>Yukichi's House</b>

19:46.150 --> 19:47.730
Oh! Good morning, Yukichi!

19:47.730 --> 19:49.400
Sorry, I have to get to work!

19:49.400 --> 19:50.910
Deodorize! Deodorize!

19:50.910 --> 19:52.810
I have to shower, too!

19:56.820 --> 20:01.800
No way! A c-c-c-c-cockroach in the b-bathroom!

20:02.580 --> 20:06.020
<i>I'm sure it's an ideal environment 
for them in the winter.</i>

20:07.140 --> 20:09.990
What should I do?! I'm going to be late!

20:09.990 --> 20:12.020
Where'd I keep the bug spray?!

20:12.020 --> 20:14.040
Bug spray! Bug spray!

20:23.870 --> 20:25.220
<i>Disposal complete.</i>

20:25.620 --> 20:27.340
A god!

20:27.340 --> 20:28.520
<i>I am a cat.</i>

20:29.870 --> 20:30.590
Shower!

20:30.590 --> 20:32.620
Th-Thanks, Yukichi!

20:33.170 --> 20:37.190
<i>I see. This human is afraid of bugs.</i>

20:37.190 --> 20:38.730
Are you hurt anywhere?

20:38.730 --> 20:40.060
Ouch...

20:41.570 --> 20:44.260
Sorry, I've been so busy lately...

20:44.910 --> 20:48.150
The place is a <i>little</i> messy right now.

20:56.500 --> 20:58.230
I'm heading out, Yukichi!

20:58.230 --> 21:00.870
I'll buy all sorts of cat 
supplies on my way back!

21:00.870 --> 21:03.440
<i>Yes, go.</i>

21:07.290 --> 21:11.460
<i>Now that I've eaten and slept,
 I have plenty of energy.</i>

21:16.250 --> 21:19.340
<i>Before you return home...</i>

21:21.750 --> 21:24.970
<i>I will also do a bit of work myself.</i>

21:29.470 --> 21:31.930
<b>Churu</b>

21:31.010 --> 21:36.980
<b>Churu</b>

21:31.060 --> 21:36.980
<b>Tonki</b>

21:32.420 --> 21:33.980
Will you eat this?

21:33.980 --> 21:36.980
<i>That night, Yukichi discovered Churu.</i>

23:06.940 --> 23:17.950
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:07.340 --> 23:09.500
<i>A masterful cat knows.</i>

23:09.850 --> 23:14.070
<i>The foxtail grass that cats enjoy 
is also known as Setaria viridis.</i>

23:14.070 --> 23:16.940
<i>Dogs are the origin of their Japanese name.</i>

23:16.940 --> 23:18.120
<i>Dogs?</i>

23:18.120 --> 23:20.790
<i>Next episode: "A Masterful Cat Is Popular."</i>

23:18.700 --> 23:21.960
Can

23:18.700 --> 23:21.960
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Popular</b>

23:20.790 --> 23:21.920
<i>Dogs?</i>
